body {
	From Kilkerran:
$blockquote{
976	Erected by JOHN McMILLAN in memory of his children JAMES who died 12 May 1778 aged 2 years, SARAH who died 8 July 1781 aged 4 years, AGNEFS who died 12 August 1798 aged 19 years, the said JOHN McMILLAN died 3 April 1804 aged 51 years.
}
Note implies John was born in 1753.

See $child-link[breckenridge-sarah-1741-mcnair-mcmillan]{Sarah Breckenridge}
}

